"""Hippie Station Science, generated by a node graph (forge/proc, the Houdini way).

    python tools/mapforge/blueprints/science_v3.py            # run the graph, one picture per node
    python tools/mapforge/mapforge.py build blueprints/science_v3.py   # the real build, checks and sprites

Nothing below is drawn by coordinate. The outline is read from the map. The streets snap to the doors the outline
already has (the west hall door, the south maintenance door) and the rooms are a slicing tree hung on those streets.
The program is the one approved on 2026-11-15 (tools/mapforge/studies/science.md).
"""
